[0.048, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've added the note and pushed. The note is a new \"To revisit\" section in\u001b[77G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/space-extraction-plan.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[108GIt\u001b[111Gsays\u001b[116Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breconsider\u001b[14Gwhether\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Ggame,\u001b[32Grather\u001b[39Gthan\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gengine,\u001b[56Gshould\u001b[63Gsupply\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gmigration\u001b[84Gfrom\u001b[89Gversion-1\u001b[99Gsaves,\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110Gto\u001b[113Gsettle\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gthat\u001b[8Gbefore slice 8\u001b[23Gcloses the boundary.\u001b[44G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m on GitHub is now at \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m5ef3346\u001b[39m,\u001b[45Gthree\u001b[51Gcommits\u001b[59Gon\u001b[62Gfrom\u001b[67G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mb690066\u001b[39m.\u001b[76GThe\u001b[80Gslice\u001b[86G3\u001b[88Gscenes\u001b[95Gcommit\u001b[102Gis\u001b[105G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0c37e69\u001b[113G\u001b[39mnow\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brather\u001b[10Gthan\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mb9896d3\u001b[39m:\u001b[24GI\u001b[26Gamended\u001b[34Git\u001b[37Gbefore\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gpush\u001b[53Gto\u001b[56Gfix\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gallow-list.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI didn'\u001b[11G re-run the gate aft\u001b[32Gr\u001b[34Gadding the note, since the change is documentation\u001b[85Gonly.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BMan\u001b[7Gfes\u001b[11G's SDK pin hasn't moved yet. When\u001b[45Gy\u001b[47Gu want it\u001b[57Gmoved, it should go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0c37e69\u001b[39m, the\u001b[93Glast\u001b[98Gcode\u001b[103Gcommit;\u001b[111G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m5ef3346\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mwould\u001b[9Galso\u001b[14Gwork.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 25s · done 9:37 pm\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mis it safe t