[0.147, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6GWrote\u001b[13G\u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines to \u001b[1m/tmp/claude-1000/4a-msg.txt\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[2m1\u001b[10G\u001b[22mTrans\u001b[16Gt:\u001b[19Gmotion profiles of no gen\u001b[45Ge, extraction slice 4a\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[10G\u001b[22mThe cruise's ac\u001b[26Ge\u001b[28Geration profile \u001b[47Gthe neutral transit module's\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[10G\u001b[22mTransit::MotionProfile,\u001b[34Gits\u001b[38Gclosed\u001b[45Gforms\u001b[51G(Seconds,\u001b[61GCovered,\u001b[70GThrust)\u001b[78Gand\u001b[82Gits\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22mcheck moved unchanged, with their tests, so a lift or a train can cover its\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22mway as a ship's cruise does. Space::CruiseDrive keeps its power law and takes\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22ma profile's time from transit; a bad profile is still refused naming the\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 8\u001b[10G\u001b[22mdrive. The profile is\u001b[32Gsaved\u001b[38Gas\u001b[41G\"Ai.CruiseProfile\"\u001b[60Guntil\u001b[66Gslice\u001b[72G7,\u001b[75Gso\u001b[78Gno\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 9\u001b[10G\u001b[22mpinned\u001b[17Ghash\u001b[22Gmoves;\u001b[29GManifest's\u001b[40G53\u001b[43Gsuites\u001b[50Gpass\u001b[55Gon\u001b[58Gthis\u001b[63Gengine\u001b[70Gwith\u001b[75Gits\u001b[79Gnames\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m0\u001b[10G\u001b[22mmoved to the \u001b[24Geutral types.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +2 lines \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ git add docs/architecture.md docs/space-extraction-plan.md source/engine/CMakeLists.txt \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsource/engine/space/CMakeLists.txt source/engine/space/include/