[0.167, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 149 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4b, transit.** The cruise's passage as any game's: an entity out of physics with its body      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 150 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     kept, placed each step along a path the game gives about a carrier, passed over by               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 151 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     fast-forward, and brought out at rest clear of what is there, in a frame the game names; a lift  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 152 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     and a train in the suite.                                                                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 149 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4b, transit.** **Done** 2026-11-22: the cruise's passage as any game's (`transit/Path.h`,      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 150 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     `Passage.h`): an entity out of physics with its body kept (`TakeOut`), placed each step along a  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 151 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     way about a carrier the game places (`Underway`, `Passages::Locate`), passed over by             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 152 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     fast-forward, and brought out at rest clear of what is there (`BringOut`, `ClearPlace`), in a    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 153 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     local frame the game names; `Transit::Passages` runs them, a lift on a profile and a train on a  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 154 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     moving ferry in the suite, fast-forwarded and loaded as stepped. The cruise is built on those    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 155 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     parts and keeps `Cruising`; the lanes and gates take their steps, arrivals and given-up          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 156 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     destinations from them, and space's private copies are gone. No pinned hash moved; Manifest's    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 157 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     53 suites on the local engine.                                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 158 \u001b[15G\u001b[22m-\u001b[17G**4c,\u001b[23Gportals.**\u001b[34GThe\u001b[38Glanes\u001b[44Gon\u001b[47Gthem:\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Gdoor\u001b[60Gbetween\u001b[68Gtwo\u001b[72Gframes\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gone\u001b[87Gwithin\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gframe.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 159 \u001b[22m  \u001b[14G -\u001b[17G**4d, slot\u001b[29Ga\u001b[31Gd gated portals.** The gat\u001b[58Gs on them: a toll booth's gated portal\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gcar\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 160 \u001b[17G\u001b[22mpark's\u001b[24Gbays.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern…\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;230;149;117mSublimating…\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
