[0.094, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 35 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// An entity on a lane: its Sim::InFrame names no system (Sim::kNoFrame) from the step it entered\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 36 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// to the step it arrives in. Its Transform is where it left, which nothing shows, since an entity\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/space-extraction-plan.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m lines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 155 \u001b[17G\u001b[22mparts\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gkeeps\u001b[33G`Cruising`;\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Glanes\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Ggates\u001b[65Gtake\u001b[70Gtheir\u001b[76Gsteps,\u001b[83Garrivals\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96Ggiven-up\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 156 \u001b[22m      destinations from them, \u001b[42Gnd \u001b[46Gpace's private\u001b[61Gcopies\u001b[68Gare\u001b[72Ggone.\u001b[78GNo\u001b[81Gpinned\u001b[88Ghash\u001b[93Gmoved;\u001b[100GManifest's\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 157 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14G   53\u001b[20Gsuites on\u001b[30Gthe local\u001b[40Gengine.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 158 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4c, portals.** The lanes on them: a door between two frames and one within a frame.            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 158 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4c, portals.** **Done** 2026-11-22: a portal as any game's (`transit/Portal.h`): an entity out \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 159 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     of its frame for a set time (`Depart`) and out at an exit the game places, in any frame, the one \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 160 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     it left included, at rest ahead of the exit and clear of what is there (`ComeOut`, `Exits`       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m161\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   through `Portals::Locate`); `Transit::Portals` runs them, a door from a building onto a moving   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 162 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     ferry and two through a lift door within the building in the suite, fast-forwarded as stepped.   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 163 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     The lanes are built on those parts and keep `OnLane`. No pinned hash moved; Manifest's 53        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 164 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     suites on the local engine.                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 165 \u001b[15G\u001b[22m-\u001b[17G**4d,\u001b[23Gslots\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Ggated\u001b[39Gportals.**\u001b[50GThe\u001b[54Ggates\u001b[60Gon\u001b[63Gthem:\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gtoll\u001b[76Gbooth's\u001b[84Ggated\u001b[90Gportal\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gcar\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 166 \u001b[22m      park's bays\u001b[29G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 167 \u001b[22m    - **4e, the smoke run's\u001b[39Gjump\u001b[44Gstage**\u001b[52Gremoved\u001b[60Gwith\u001b[65Gits\u001b[69Gfive\u001b[74Gwords,\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gjump\u001b[90Gbeing\u001b[96GManifest's.\r\u001b[15C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m25m 50s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m27.8k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
