6Gthe\u001b[30Ggates\u001b[36Gon\u001b[39Ggated\u001b[45Gportals\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Gslots,\u001b[64Gwith\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gtoll\u001b[76Gbooth\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gcar\u001b[92Gpark's\u001b[99Gbays\u001b[104Gas\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gtest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bconsumers. It's the biggest part: abou\u001b[42G 430 line\u001b[53Gof gate code, with saved \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGate\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTransit\u001b[39m components to keep byte\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[5Gr byte. Opus a\u001b[20G high effort; now is a\u001b[43Ggood point to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[67G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 29m 4s · done 11:11 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe're moving Jettison's space feature\u001b[76Gand slice 4c (portals, with the lanes rebuilt\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
