01b[3mWe're moving Jettison's space features into neutral transit code, and slice 4c (portals, with the lanes rebuilt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bon them) is now committed. Next is 4d: rebuilding the gates on gated portals and slots, then running the full gate \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbefore a push. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/compact\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[32C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;147;165;255m✶\u001b[3GCompacting conversation… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(0s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
