[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3GOn this engine, all 33 suites pass,\u001b[40Gidy and\u001b[48Gformat ch\u001b[58Gcks are clean, and the neutral-words\u001b[95Gcheck\u001b[101Gpasses.\u001b[109GManifest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpasses\u001b[10G53/53\u001b[16Gagainst\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Glocal\u001b[34Gengine.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI haven't run the full Jettison gate. 4c\u001b[44Gopens\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gnext\u001b[59G2–3-commit\u001b[70Gchunk,\u001b[77Gso\u001b[80Git\u001b[83Gruns\u001b[88Gafter\u001b[94G4d,\u001b[98Gbefore\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gnext\u001b[114Gpush.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4c\u001b[6Gisn't\u001b[12Gpushed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext is 4d\u001b[22m, r\u001b[17Gbuilding\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Ggates\u001b[36Gon\u001b[39Ggated\u001b[45Gportals\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Gslots,\u001b[64Gwith\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gtoll\u001b[76Gbooth\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gcar\u001b[92Gpark's\u001b[99Gbays\u001b[104Gas\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gtest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bconsumers.\u001b[14GIt's\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gbiggest\u001b[31Gpart:\u001b[37Gabout\u001b[43G430\u001b[47Glines\u001b[53Gof\u001b[56Ggate\u001b[61Gcode,\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72Gsaved\u001b[78G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGate\u001b[83G\u001b[39mand\u001b[87G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTransit\u001b[95G\u001b[39mcomponents\u001b[106Gto\u001b[109Gkeep\u001b[114Gbyte\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor byte. Opus at h\u001b[23Ggh\u001b[26Geffort; now is a good point to\u001b[57G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 29m 4s · done 11:11 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe're moving Jettison's space features into neutral transit code, and slice 4c (portals, with the lanes rebuilt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bon them) is now committed. Next is 4d: rebuilding the gates on gated portals and slots, then running the full gate \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mbefore a push. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/compact\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mhajime\u001b[39m  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[49m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
