[0.108, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m162 \u001b[22m      ferry and two through a lift\u001b[46Gdoor\u001b[51Gwithin\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gbuilding\u001b[71Gin\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gsuite,\u001b[85Gfast-forwarded\u001b[100Gas\u001b[103Gstepped.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m163 \u001b[22m      The lanes are built on those\u001b[46Gparts\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Gkeep\u001b[61G`OnLane`.\u001b[71GNo\u001b[74Gpinned\u001b[81Ghash\u001b[86Gmoved;\u001b[93GManifest's\u001b[104G53\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 164 \u001b[17G\u001b[22msuites\u001b[24Gon\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Glocal\u001b[37Gengine.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 165 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4d, slots and gated portals.** The gates on them: a toll booth's gated portal and a car        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 166 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     park's bays.                                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 165 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **4d, slots and gated portals.** **Done** 2026-11-22: a slot as any game's (`transit/Slot.h`):   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 166 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     what one entity holds at a time until it gives it up or its hold lapses, with others waiting     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m167 +\u001b[17G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfirst come first (`Transit::Slot`, `Claim`;\u001b[61G`Hold`,\u001b[69G`Wait`,\u001b[77G`GiveUp`,\u001b[87G`DropGone`,\u001b[99G`Lapse`,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 168 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     `Serve`, `NextLapse`), and a gated portal as a slot with a sensor its holder goes through and    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 169 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     others pass (`Crossed`); a car park's bays, fast-forwarded as stepped, and a toll booth's        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 170 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     barrier onto a portal in the suite. The gates are built on those parts, `Gate` and `Transit`     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 171 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     derived from the slot and claim and keeping their saved fields.                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 172 \u001b[22m    - **4e, the\u001b[27Gsmoke\u001b[33Grun's\u001b[39Gjump\u001b[44Gstage**\u001b[52Gremoved\u001b[60Gwith\u001b[65Gits\u001b[69Gfive\u001b[74Gwords,\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gjump\u001b[90Gbeing\u001b[96GManifest's.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 173 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m5.\u001b[15G**Berths.**\u001b[27G`dock`\u001b[34Gwithout\u001b[42Gstations'\u001b[52Gcelestial\u001b[62Gtie:\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gstation\u001b[77Glayout\u001b[84Gtakes\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gplacement\u001b[104Gits\u001b[108Ggame\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 174 \u001b[22m  \u001b[14G gives; Manifest's\u001b[33Gpads on\u001b[41Gberths; p\u001b[51Gns held.\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m \u001b[14Ghell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[14C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m7m 4s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m42.7k\u001b[31Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
