[0.072, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTests in the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtransit\u001b[39m suite:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mA car park's bays:\u001b[22m cars hold a bay in turn, one leaves the queue, and holds lapse. A fast-forwarded run saves\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsame as a stepped one, in 6 calls.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mA toll booth's barrier:\u001b[22m th\u001b[33Gcar that \u001b[43Gaid \u001b[48Goes\u001b[52Gthr\u001b[56Gugh\u001b[60Gthe portal. The waiting car is served \u001b[99Gext and goes\u001b[112Gthrough\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe following s\u001b[21Gep, though it was already at the barr\u001b[59Ger. The\u001b[67Gunpaid car passes \u001b[86Gnd is not sent.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe gates are rebuilt on these parts.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mGate\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTransit\u001b[39m are\u001b[26Gnow\u001b[30Gbuilt\u001b[36Gon\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gneutral\u001b[51Gslot\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gclaim\u001b[66Gtypes.\u001b[73GThey\u001b[78Gsave\u001b[83Gunder\u001b[89Gtheir\u001b[95Gold\u001b[99Gfield\u001b[105Gnames\u001b[111G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcleared\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgate\u001b[39m),\u001b[12Gso\u001b[15Gno\u001b[18Gpinned\u001b[25Ghash\u001b[30Gmoved.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- In C++ th\u001b[15G gate's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcleared\u001b[39m is\u001b[34Gn\u001b[36Gw \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mholder\u001b[39m, so the engine's \u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Ge tes\u001b[71Gs were upda\u001b[83Ged. Manifest doesn't read those\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  field\u001b[11G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mChecks:\u001b[22m all 33 engine suites pass, tidy and format checks are clean, and Manifest\u001b[85Gpasses\u001b[92G53/53\u001b[98Gagainst\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110Glocal\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bengine.\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/arch