[0.106, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m177\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   gives; Manifest's \u001b[34Gads on berth\u001b[47G; pins held.  \u001b[62G  \u001b[65G      \u001b[72G   \u001b[76G   \u001b[80G  \u001b[83G     \u001b[89G   \u001b[93G  \u001b[96G \u001b[98G    \u001b[103G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 177 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   gives; Manifest's pads on berths; pins held.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m In three parts:\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 178 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **5a, berths in neutral words.** **Done** 2026-11-23: the dock's C++ in the words of any game's  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 179 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     platforms, berths and vehicles (`Dock::Platform`, `Berth`, `Vehicle`, `PlatformLayout`,          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 180 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     `BerthLayout`, `BerthClassDefinition`, `VehicleDefinition`, `RequestBerth`, `ReleaseBerth` and   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 181 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     the events `Berth*`), its saved and reflected names kept, and its refusals' messages so worded;  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 182 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     `Docks::MakePlatform` puts a platform on the rails of a body of the frame's model, which is the  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 183 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     game's placement, the star system no longer named. Rails offset from the body were tried and     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 184 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     dropped: composing an identity turn changed a zero's sign in a berth's saved rails and moved a   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 185 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     pin. Manifest names the neutral types, its messages' tests reworded; its 53 suites and every pin \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 186 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     held on the local engine. The list is empty.                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 187 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **5b, the dock suite on neutral frames**: its flights in a frame model of its own, a platform on \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ma                                                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 188 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     moving body, rather than the sample's Halcyon, and `jettison_space` off its link.                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 189 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   - **5c, the ai suite on neutral frames**: steering's flight round a moving platform the same way.  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m19\u001b[12G\u001b[22m6.\u001b[15G**The move.** `celesti\u001b[38Gl`'s orbit\u001b[49G, bodies and\u001b[62Ggalaxy, `space`'s\u001b[80Gsetting \u001b[89Gnd the routes into\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 191 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mManifest's\u001b[26G`space`\u001b[34Gmodule,\u001b[42Greflected\u001b[52Gnames\u001b[58Gunchanged;\u001b[69G`celestial`,\u001b[82G`space`\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94G`spacescene`\u001b[107Gleave\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m he engine\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Gits\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 192 \u001b[22m    optional list. Manifest's suites\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Gpins\u001b[57Gheld\u001b[62Gon\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gnew\u001b[73GSDK\u001b[77Gpin.\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
