0m 191 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     it. The case ordering space's lanes and cruise after the docks is the space suite's, which links \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m192 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     the dock for it.                                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 193 \u001b[22m    - **5c, the ai suite on neutral frames**: steering's flight round a moving platform the same way.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m194 \u001b[22m 6. **The move.** `celestial`'s orbits, bodies and galaxy, `space`'s setting and the routes\u001b[103Ginto\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m195 \u001b[22m    Manifest's `space` module, reflected\u001b[52Gnames\u001b[58Gunchanged;\u001b[69G`celestial`,\u001b[82G`space`\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94G`spacescene`\u001b[107Gleave\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[10G \u001b[22m he\u001b[15Gengine\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Gits\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2Bunn\u001b[13Gshell commands…\r\u001b[18C\u001b[9B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
