[0.081, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m3\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe samples' check alone,\u001b[41Gand `n\u001b[48Gutral_words` reads every\u001b[73Gmodule. The re\u001b[88Gsons'\u001b[94Gwords\u001b[100Gunder\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[16G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mreason.space.*` left th\u001b[40G \u001b[42Gng\u001b[45Gne\u001b[50Gtable\u001b[56G with the\u001b[66Gm\u001b[68Gdule; Manifest has no string tables yet,\u001b[109Gso\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m5\u001b[18G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242my wa\u001b[23Gt in Jettison's hist\u001b[44Gry for its client (L15). Every pin\u001b[79Gheld: Manifest's 54 suites, the  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnew\u001b[19G`spac\u001b[25G` among them, on the local engine. A\u001b[62Gchitectu\u001b[71Ge's sections on jump\u001b[92G,\u001b[94Ggate\u001b[99G, routes\u001b[108Gand\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m7\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mc\u001b[17Gui\u001b[20Gi\u001b[22Gg still describe what \u001b[45Gs now Manifest's\u001b[62Gcode, for slice 8 to\u001b[83Gmove. \u001b[90G      \u001b[97G      \u001b[104G    \u001b[109G  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 208 \u001b[22m 7. **Saved names.** Every saved and reflected name still in the setting's words or the old module's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 209 \u001b[22m    (`\"byHull\"`, `Ai.OnLane`, `Ai.Cruising` and the rest) renamed at once, and `Dock.Transfer`\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 210 \u001b[22m    and `Dock.Buggy`, kept with no behaviour since slice 2, dropped: one save version and its\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth\u001b[8Gbuilds\u001b[15Gare\u001b[19Ggreen.\u001b[26GI'm\u001b[30Gupdating\u001b[39GManifest's\u001b[50Gmodule\u001b[57Gtable\u001b[63Gfor\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gnew\u001b[75G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mspace\u001b[81G\u001b[39mmodule\u001b[88Gbefore\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gformat,\u001b[107Gtidy\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Gfull\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgate checks.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m \u001b[14Ghell\u001b[19Gcommand…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && clang-format -i \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B'/home/ivan/projects/manifest/source/game/space/tests/GalaxyTests.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'/home/ivan/projects/manifest/source/game/space/tests/GatesTests.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'/hom\u001b[12G/ivan/projects/manifest/\u001b[37Gou\u001b[41Ge/game/space/tests/CelestialTests.cpp' '/home/ivan/projects/manifest…\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
