[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G-\u001b[7GWith\u001b[12Gno\u001b[15Goptional\u001b[24Gmodules\u001b[32Gleft,\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison_check_optional\u001b[62G\u001b[39mis\u001b[65Gnow\u001b[69G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison_check_dependencies\u001b[97G\u001b[39mand\u001b[101Gonly\u001b[106Gchecks\u001b[113Gthat\u001b[118Gno\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G    engine module needs a sample.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B    - Th\u001b[10G words check now covers every\u001b[40Gmodule,\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Gits\u001b[56Gallow-list\u001b[67Gstays\u001b[73Gempty.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- The module-graph docs are updated, along with the plan's slice 6 entry.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSpace reasons' text:\u001b[22m the English and German wording for the space reasons left the engine's\u001b[97Gstring\u001b[104Gtables\u001b[111Gwith\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcode. Manifest has no string tables yet, so for now the text exists only in Jettison's history.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChecks:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJettison:\u001b[22m the full gate (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan\u001b[39m) passed in 212 s. The first run failed because \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mci.sh\u001b[39m still built\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison_space_tests\u001b[39m; I removed that\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gfolded\u001b[53Git\u001b[56Ginto\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gcommit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mManifest:\u001b[22m all 54 suites pass on the\u001b[41Glocal\u001b[47Gengine\u001b[54Gwithout\u001b[62G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mspace\u001b[39m,\u001b[69Gso\u001b[72Gevery\u001b[78Gpinned\u001b[85Ghash\u001b[90Gheld.\u001b[96GIts\u001b[100Gclang-tidy\u001b[111Gand\u001b[115Gformat\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcheck\u001b[11Gare\u001b[15Gclean.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mNot run:\u001b[22m Manifest's\u001b[25Gown\u001b[29Ggate,\u001b[35Gwhich\u001b[41Gfetches\u001b[49G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mb7d4580\u001b[57G\u001b[39mfrom\u001b[62GGitHub\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gcan't\u001b[79Grun\u001b[83Guntil\u001b[89GJettison\u001b[98Gis\u001b[101Gpushed.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThe architecture doc's\u001b[26Glong \u001b[32Gections\u001b[40Go\u001b[42G jumps, gates, routes and cruising still\u001b[83Gdescribe\u001b[92Gcode\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Gis\u001b[105Gnow\u001b[109GManifest's.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gleft\u001b[10Gthem\u001b[15Gfor\u001b[19Gslice\u001b[25G8's\u001b[29Gdoc\u001b[33Grewrite.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Say \"push\" to push both, then I'll run Manifest's gate. Slice 7 renames every saved name, so every pin moves once. I'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m before it and use Opus at high effort.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 32m 46s · done 1:09 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[41C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← 1\u001b[46Gagent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
