[0.075, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 811 \u001b[22m reported at. Definitions migrate the same way ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecided\u001b[39m](decisions.md)). A version newer than\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 812 \u001b[22m the build's, or one the chain does not reach, is refused by name before any step runs, and every\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 813 \u001b[22m read leaves what it was reading into as it was when the data does not fit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(docs/roadmap.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 157 \u001b[22m   waypoints, the failure here, which players work round with a slow precision mode or scripts. So\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[12G\u001b[22m  the solution: an approach corridor flown without stopping, at a speed that falls with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gdistance\u001b[23Gleft;\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gstation\u001b[41Gnot\u001b[45Gan\u001b[48Gobstacle\u001b[57Gon\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gcorridor's\u001b[75Glast\u001b[80Gleg,\u001b[85Gas\u001b[88Git\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gnot\u001b[98Gon\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gway\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 160 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  down (`\u001b[48;2;92;2;0mbyHull\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m`); Arrive damping the velocity across its line rather than pursuing; and a            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 160 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  down (`\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mbyShape\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m`); Arrive damping the velocity across its line rather than pursuing; and a           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 161 \u001b[22m   reservation\u001b[26Gthat\u001b[31Glapses\u001b[38Gwhen\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gship\u001b[50Gstops\u001b[56Gmaking\u001b[63Gprogress\u001b[72Grather\u001b[79Gthan\u001b[84Gat\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Gfixed\u001b[95Gtime.\u001b[101GMeasured\u001b[110Gby\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 162 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mships\u001b[20Gflown\u001b[26Gin\u001b[29Gfrom\u001b[34Gevery\u001b[40Gside\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gspeed,\u001b[56Gone\u001b[60Gqueued\u001b[67Gbehind\u001b[74Ganother\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gnext\u001b[94Gpad,\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Gno\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 163 \u001b[22m   arrival slower than the \u001b[39Gtopgap's.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRead\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mdocs/spa\u001b[15Ge-extraction-plan.md\r\u001b[13C\u001b[2B21m 27s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m97.6k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
