[0.148, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 213 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   mods against the names (the user's, 2026-11-22).                                                   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 213 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   mods against the names (the user's, 2026-11-22).\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m **Done** 2026-11-23: the world's version 5\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 214 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   renames the engine's types in an older save (`Dock.Pad` to `Dock.Berth`, `Physics.Thrusters` to    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 215 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `Physics.Handling` and the rest); each component's chain renames its fields (`Dock.Berth` 3,       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 216 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `Dock.Platform`, `Dock.Docking`, `Ai.Destination` and `Physics.Body` 2, the docks' shapes from     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 217 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `hulls/` and `stations/` to `vehicles/` and `platforms/`, the physics state's layout 5 with them); \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 218 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   a command still queued has its fields renamed as it is read; and the two retired storages are read \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m219\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m and left out. They are renamed by type rather than over the\u001b[75Gwhole\u001b[81Gtable,\u001b[88Gsince\u001b[94GManifest's\u001b[105Gown\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 220 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   types share field names such as `ship` and `padClass`. The docks' definitions, the scene's         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 221 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `body` (format 3) and the dock reasons' keys moved with them, and `Ai.CruiseProfile` is            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 222 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `Transit.MotionProfile`. Manifest's space types are `Space.*`, and it has no saves to migrate.     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 223 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   Five engine pins moved (sim's two, physics', steering's and the dock approach's) and four of       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 224 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   Manifest's. Each was shown to be the names alone: with the old names, versions and dropped storages\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 225 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   put back, every one returned, and Manifest's own tree passed all 54 suites on the engine so        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 226 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   reverted. A save the build before wrote (`dock/tests/fixtures/saves`) loads to the state this      \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 227 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   build reaches from the same start.                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 228 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m8.\u001b[15G**Close-out.**\u001b[30GThe\u001b[34Gallow-list\u001b[45Gempty;\u001b[52Garchitecture,\u001b[66Gscope,\u001b[73Ggame\u001b[78Gintegration\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Gsample\u001b[105Gdocs\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 229 \u001b[22m    rewritten for \u001b[30Ghe bound\u001b[39Gry as it is; Manifest's boun\u001b[68Gary\u001b[72Gassessment's\u001b[85Gstatus;\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gconsumer\u001b[106Gmatrix\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 230 \u001b[22m    (ground, Manifest) run; a cross-review of the whole, as\u001b[71Gat\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Gstage's\u001b[84Gend.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mOsmosing…\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m33m 12s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m113.8k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
