[1.666, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5GManifest has n\u001b[20G saves of its own, so it needed no migration.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mProof the pins moved by names alone.\u001b[22m Fiv\u001b[44G Jettison pins\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gfour\u001b[68GManifest\u001b[77Gpins\u001b[82Gmoved.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BI temporarily put back the old \u001b[37Games, \u001b[44Ghe version\u001b[55Gnumbers and\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gtwo\u001b[75Gdropped\u001b[83Gcomponents.\u001b[95GEvery\u001b[101GJettison\u001b[110Gpin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breturned\u001b[14Gto\u001b[17Gits\u001b[21Gold\u001b[25Gvalue,\u001b[32Gand\u001b[36GManifest's\u001b[47Gtree\u001b[52Gfrom\u001b[57Gbefore\u001b[64Gthis\u001b[69Gchange\u001b[76Gpassed\u001b[83Gall\u001b[87G54\u001b[90Gsuites\u001b[97Gagainst\u001b[105Gthat\u001b[110Gengine.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Before editing, the old build wrote a sav\u001b[47G of a busy h\u001b[60Grbour\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/engine/dock/tests/fixtures/saves/harbour-version-4.world\u001b[39m). A new test\u001b[83Gl\u001b[85Gads it and checks i\u001b[105G reaches\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsame state thi\u001b[21Gbuild reaches from the same start.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mLeft out on purpose:\u001b[22m the word \"system\" alone isn't on the vocabulary\u001b[72Glist,\u001b[78Gso I\u001b[83Gkept \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPhysics.Pick\u001b[39m'\u001b[103G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msystem\u001b[39m field and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mother_system\u001b[39m reasons. The \u001b[34Gtring\u001b[41Gables' wording\u001b[56G(\"the\u001b[62Gship…\")\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtextures/hulls/\u001b[94G\u001b[39masset\u001b[100Gpaths\u001b[106Gare\u001b[110Galso\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bunchanged.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BManifest's own gat\u001b[22G, which builds a\u001b[39Gainst the pinned\u001b[56Gcommit, can only run once \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1297b9f\u001b[39m is on Gi\u001b[99GHub, \u001b[105Go that'\u001b[113G the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst check\u001b[15Gafter\u001b[21Gyou\u001b[25Gsay\u001b[29G\"push\".\u001b[37GBefore\u001b[44Gslice\u001b[50G8,\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gclose-out\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72Gits\u001b[76Gcross-review,\u001b[90GI'd\u001b[94G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[103G\u001b[39mand\u001b[107Gstay\u001b[112Gon\u001b[115GOpus\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bat\u001b[6Ghigh\u001b[11Geffort.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 48m 11s · done 2:23 am\u001b[37G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mHow is Claude doing this session? (optional)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1\u001b[39m: Bad    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m2\u001b[39m: Fine   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m3\u001b[39m: Good   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0\u001b[39m: Dismiss\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
