\u001b[110Gn migrated,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band the five scene files in\u001b[33Gthe repo were updated.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GManifest has\u001b[18Gno saves of\u001b[31Gts own, s\u001b[42Git needed no migration.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mProof the pins moved by names alone.\u001b[40G\u001b[22mFive\u001b[45GJettison\u001b[54Gpins\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gfour\u001b[68GManifest\u001b[77Gpins\u001b[82Gmoved.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I temporarily put back the old names, the ver\u001b[51Gion numbers\u001b[63Gand the two dropped components.\u001b[95GEvery\u001b[101GJettison\u001b[110Gpin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gre\u001b[8Gurned to its old value,\u001b[32Gan\u001b[36GM\u001b[38Gnifes\u001b[44G's\u001b[47Gtree from before this change pass\u001b[83Gall 54 suites agains\u001b[104G that\u001b[110Gengine.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GB\u001b[7Gfo\u001b[10Ge editing,\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gold build wrote a save of a busy harbour\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/engine/dock/tests/fixtures/saves/harbour-version-4.world\u001b[39m).\u001b[72GA\u001b[74Gnew\u001b[78Gtest\u001b[83Gloads\u001b[89Git\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96Gchecks\u001b[103Git\u001b[106Greaches\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsame state this build reaches from the same start.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B    \u001b[10G     \u001b[16G    \u001b[21G     \u001b[27G       \u001b[35G    \u001b[40G   \u001b[44G   \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
