[0.172, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 246 \u001b[22m - **Planetary rings stay in the renderer** (2026-11-22), the one named exception: atmosphere is\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m47\u001b[14G\u001b[22mneutral\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Grings\u001b[32Gare\u001b[36Gnot,\u001b[41Gbut\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Grenderer\u001b[58Ghas\u001b[62Gno\u001b[65Gextension\u001b[75Gpoint\u001b[81Gfor\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Ggame's\u001b[94Gown\u001b[98Gpasses\u001b[105Gand\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m48\u001b[12G\u001b[22m  Manifest\u001b[23Gno rend\u001b[31Grer yet.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(source/engine/space/j7b-msg.txt)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m8\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines to \u001b[1msource/engine/space/j7b-msg.txt\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1 \u001b[22mPlan: slice 7's pinned\u001b[32Ggate,\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gnames\u001b[52Gleft\u001b[57Gfor\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gclose-out\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22mManifest's gate passed on the pin to 1297b9f. The plan names the words\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22mslice 7 left for slice 8 to settle or keep: a pick's system field, two\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 5 \u001b[22mreasons, the string tables' wording and the textures/hulls paths. The\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6 \u001b[22mcargo deck's note \u001b[28Gs in \u001b[34Ghe\u001b[37Gpas\u001b[41G tense, now that the deck is dropp\u001b[76Gd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8 \u001b[22mCo-Authored-By: Clau\u001b[31G Opus 5\u001b[39G5\u001b[41G<noreply@anthropic.com>\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BComm\u001b[8Gtted\u001b[13G\u001b[1m5b31574\u001b[22m, pushed to \u001b[1mfeature-base\u00